 ide of Chicago. A paid regular at top-tier clubs like Zanies\, Laugh Factor
 y\, and the Chicago Improv\, DJ has built a reputation for sharp storytelli
 ng and joke writing. He performed on the Nateland Live showcase in Nashvill
 e and was invited to the prestigious 312 Comedy Festival A-List Showcase in
  both 2024 and 2025. In 2025\, he recorded a 10-minute special for OFTV.\n\
 nDrawing from his unique background\, including his upbringing on the South
